#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2307
msgid "How to automatically begin and end filling"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2309
msgid ""
"Starting with Python 3.14, you can use the :func:`fill` :term:`context "
"manager` instead of :func:`begin_fill` and :func:`end_fill` to automatically "
"begin and end fill. Here is an example::"
msgstr ""
"Ab Python 3.14 kannst du den :term:`Kontextmanager <context "
"manager>` :func:`fill` anstelle von :func:`begin_fill` und :func:`end_fill` "
"verwenden, um das Füllen automatisch zu beginnen und zu beenden. Hier ist "
"ein Beispiel::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2313
msgid ""
"with fill():\n"
"    for i in range(4):\n"
"        forward(100)\n"
"        right(90)\n"
"\n"
"forward(200)"
msgstr ""
"with fill():\n"
"    for i in range(4):\n"
"        forward(100)\n"
"        right(90)\n"
"\n"
"forward(200)"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2320
msgid "The code above is equivalent to::"
msgstr "Der obige Code ist äquivalent zu::"

#: ../../library/turtle.rst:2322
msgid ""
"begin_fill()\n"
"for i in range(4):\n"
"    forward(100)\n"
"    right(90)\n"
"end_fill()\n"
"\n"
"forward(200)"
msgstr ""
"begin_fill()\n"
"for i in range(4):\n"
"    forward(100)\n"
"    right(90)\n"
"end_fill()\n"
"\n"
"forward(200)"

